### 创建章节
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chapters/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book_id": "your_book_id",
  "title": "测试章节",
  "content": "这是一个测试章节的内容"
}

### 获取章节（游客）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chapters/{chapter_id}/guest

### 获取章节（认证）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chapters/{chapter_id}
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}

### 更新章节
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chapters/{chapter_id}
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "更新后的章节标题",
  "content": "更新后的章节内容"
}

### 删除章节（需要管理员权限）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chapters/{chapter_id}
Authorization: Bearer {admin_token}
